      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[3].lines.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[4].lines.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "This time\u2026 I tried something a bit more advanced."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: I added a meta element. Just a tiny one.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: Take a close look at the table.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[3]
      value: Maybe find something you can use to hit with.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[4]
      value: "Sorry. I just\u2026 I was afrad you might leave right away."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "I really\u2026 broke the fourth wall, didn\u2019t I?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "Sorry. I can tone it down\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "You know\u2026 those successful games? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[3]
      value: They tinker with their core logic, rebuild things deep down
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[1].lines.Array.data[4]
      value: "So\u2026 right, I think I broke the encoding system"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "Yeah\u2026 I guess I am easy."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "But\u2026 does simple mean boring? "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: Thanks for telling me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[2].lines.Array.data[3]
      value: "I\u2026 I\u2019ll remember that word."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[3].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "\u2026Really? You think I\u2019m\u2026 fun?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[3].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "I thought maybe\u2026 you were only staying out of politeness."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[3].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: Thanks for telling me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[3].lines.Array.data[3]
      value: "I\u2026 I\u2019ll remember that word."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[4].lines.Array.data[0]
      value: "I\u2026 I guess I\u2019m just for kids, huh."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[4].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "But I really tried to be taken seriously\u2026 just once."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[4].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: Thanks for telling me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2578631016077940569, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueData.Array.data[4].lines.Array.data[3]
      value: "I\u2026 I\u2019ll remember that word."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3760232815638835980, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: LinePrinter
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3760232815638835980, guid: 2705de4fbe856e14497a3a4493f1da63, type: 3}
